===Etymology 1===
Derived from a stem also found in dialectal {{m|fi|kuurne}} that is ultimately probably of {{der|fi|bat}} origin (compare {{cog|lv|kurls||deaf}} and {{cog|lt|kurtus}}, {{m|lt|kurčias}}). Possibly a cognate with {{cog|et|kurt}}.

